### dotnet-api-vendored-chart-config
#### source: dotnet-api
# Helm cannot reference files outside a chart directory, so the helm build step COPIES
# App/Config into each chart to bundle as ConfigMaps. Regenerated per build, never
# committed: a committed copy would let the chart ship config the app no longer reads.
infra/*/files/
